 "final_message": "Sam and Nadia's intent to proceed is recorded with Brightpath Home Lending, and both underwriting conditions have a response in. Application BHL-26001 is now \"In underwriting\". I didn't submit anything to the other two lenders.\n\n- **Loan Estimate:** The rate is 7.250%, the total monthly payment is $3,485.58 and closing costs are $13,200. All three are within the limits, so I recorded the intent to proceed, signed with both borrowers' names.\n- **Documents:**\n  - **Requested documents:** I uploaded 12 files and submitted them to underwriting. They are the Aug and Sep 2026 statements for the four personal accounts and the last two payslips for each of them. The business account was left out.\n  - **Deposit condition:** Underwriting asked about an $8,000 deposit on 09/03/2026 into Sam's Juniper checking (ending 4417). I asked Sam and Nadia, who said it was a gift from Sam's parents toward the down payment and is not a loan. I sent that as the written explanation.\n  - **W-2 condition:** I attached both 2025 W-2s.\n\nNothing else was shared. The next step is for the lender to review the responses.",
